<view class="enrollment-page ab-safe-bottom"><view class="enrollment-header"><view><text class="enrollment-header__eyebrow">AB CLUB · INTEREST</text><text class="enrollment-header__title">兴趣登记</text><text class="enrollment-header__subtitle">P0 不是订单，也不是支付承诺</text></view><ab-evidence-label mode="{{runtimeMode}}" /></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="enrollment-loading" aria-role="status">服务端正在检查资格、重复登记、当前状态与支付门…</view><view wx:elif="{{loaded}}" class="enrollment-panel"><view class="status-block"><text class="status-block__label">服务端资格检查</text><text class="status-block__value">{{eligibilityLabel}}</text><text class="status-block__detail">{{eligibilityDetail}}</text></view><view class="status-block"><text class="status-block__label">当前兴趣登记状态</text><text class="status-block__value">{{enrollmentStateLabel}}</text><text class="status-block__detail">活动状态、时间、重复提交、容量、当前版本与幂等键由服务端事务重新检查。</text></view><view class="status-block status-block--payment" aria-role="note"><text class="status-block__label">真实微信支付能力</text><text class="status-block__value">{{paymentStateLabel}}</text><text class="status-block__detail">{{paymentReasonLabel}}</text></view><button wx:if="{{canRegisterInterest}}" class="primary-action" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="registerInterest">{{busy ? '正在提交…' : '登记兴趣（INTEREST）'}}</button><button wx:if="{{canCancelInterest}}" class="secondary-action" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="cancelInterest">{{busy ? '正在提交…' : '取消兴趣登记'}}</button><view wx:if="{{operationMessage}}" class="operation-message" aria-role="status" aria-live="polite">{{operationMessage}}</view><view class="request-boundary" aria-role="note"><text>客户端请求只包含 eventId、条款版本、幂等键，以及取消时的当前版本。</text><text>城市、人数、容量、标签资格和 organizer 角色均不能由客户端注入。</text><text>支付能力未满足时没有支付按钮，也没有模拟支付成功。</text></view></view><ab-event-state wx:else kind="{{stateKind}}" title="{{stateTitle}}" description="{{stateDescription}}" detail="{{stateDetail}}" /></view>